  "limits": "Finite single-host plaintext loopback. Repeated queries use two retained clients after temporary-room waves, not a large active list. HTTP management snapshots are exact functional checks, not a throughput benchmark. Rates/heartbeats are disabled for the query probe, default queues retained. Rehash allocates metadata under the write lock; gated filling/draining CPU includes HTTP inspection. RSS is event-boundary, not an allocation census or page-return guarantee. Ordinary throughput ranges overlap and p99 buckets match; no general traffic speedup. Profiles/exploration/oracles/rejected diagnostics are excluded from timing medians. Large active inspection/lock contention, unpaced departure, multi-hour/TLS/proxy operation, clusters and hosted CI/deployment remain unverified."
